{"version":4,"tracks":{"09_Unit 1 Talking time.mp3":{"segments":[{"text":"Shenshen, it’s your photo. So sweet. I love it!","start":14.5,"end":17.8,"timing":"v4.2-0.1s-talking-edge-reviewed"},{"text":"Thank you, Xiaojiang. I’m glad you like it. Taking photos helps me keep the sweet moments in life.","start":18.3,"end":23.8,"timing":"v4.2-0.1s-talking-edge-reviewed"},{"text":"I’m going to join the Photography Club this term.","start":24.3,"end":27.5,"timing":"v4.2-0.1s-talking-edge-reviewed"},{"text":"Good idea. You can meet new friends and have fun at the same time!","start":28.1,"end":31.9,"timing":"v4.2-0.1s-talking-edge-reviewed"},{"text":"Look, this is Xiaopu’s painting.","start":32.8,"end":35.7,"timing":"v4.2-0.1s-talking-edge-reviewed"},{"text":"Wow, the night view of the Huangpu River. It’s beautiful!","start":36.5,"end":42.6,"timing":"v4.2-0.1s-talking-edge-reviewed"},{"text":"I love this painting too. The colours are just amazing.","start":43.1,"end":47.6,"timing":"v4.2-0.1s-talking-edge-reviewed"},{"text":"Xiaopu learns how to use colours well in the Art Club. It’s fun to play with colours.","start":48.1,"end":58.5,"timing":"v4.2-0.1s-talking-edge-reviewed"},{"text":"That’s nice. I am going to join the Art Club. I’d like to give it a try.","start":59.2,"end":68.7,"timing":"v4.2-0.1s-talking-edge-reviewed"}],"duration":70.008,"method":"v4.2-0.1s-talking-edge-reviewed","timingPrecision":0.1},"10_Unit 1 Story time.mp3":{"segments":[{"text":"At the Pottery Club, Miss Li says, “All the brush pots are dry now.","start":11.1,"end":16.9,"method":"waveform-dp-v4","timing":"v4.1-0.1s-waveform-reviewed"},{"text":"Today, you need to paint them.”","start":17.5,"end":19.7,"method":"waveform-dp-v4","timing":"v4.1-0.1s-waveform-reviewed"},{"text":"James gets his brush pot.","start":21.1,"end":23.3,"method":"waveform-dp-v4","timing":"v4.1-0.1s-waveform-reviewed"},{"text":"“It doesn’t look very nice!”","start":24.3,"end":26.2,"method":"waveform-dp-v4","timing":"v4.1-0.1s-waveform-reviewed"},{"text":"“Don’t worry,” Miss Li says. “It’s about to change.”","start":26.9,"end":31.0,"method":"anchor","timing":"v4.1-0.1s-waveform-reviewed"},{"text":"“What do you think I should paint?”","start":31.9,"end":33.8,"method":"waveform-dp-v4","timing":"v4.1-0.1s-waveform-reviewed"},{"text":"James asks Xiaopu.","start":34.5,"end":36.3,"method":"waveform-dp-v4","timing":"v4.1-0.1s-waveform-reviewed"},{"text":"“How about bamboo?","start":37.6,"end":39.4,"method":"waveform-dp-v4","timing":"v4.1-0.1s-waveform-reviewed"},{"text":"Bamboo is one of the four noble plants in Chinese culture.”","start":39.8,"end":44.1,"method":"waveform-dp-v4","timing":"v4.1-0.1s-waveform-reviewed"},{"text":"“Good idea!”","start":48.9,"end":49.9,"method":"waveform-dp-v4","timing":"v4.1-0.1s-waveform-reviewed"},{"text":"James begins to paint.","start":50.5,"end":52.2,"method":"waveform-dp-v4","timing":"v4.1-0.1s-waveform-reviewed"},{"text":"“Oh, it’s hard to draw the leaves!”","start":52.8,"end":55.3,"method":"waveform-dp-v4","timing":"v4.1-0.1s-waveform-reviewed"},{"text":"James says.","start":56.2,"end":57.2,"method":"waveform-dp-v4","timing":"v4.1-0.1s-waveform-reviewed"},{"text":"“Don’t give up.","start":57.8,"end":58.8,"method":"waveform-dp-v4","timing":"v4.1-0.1s-waveform-reviewed"},{"text":"Draw like this!”","start":59.4,"end":60.7,"method":"waveform-dp-v4","timing":"v4.1-0.1s-waveform-reviewed"},{"text":"Xiaopu shows James.","start":61.5,"end":63.4,"method":"waveform-dp-v4","timing":"v4.1-0.1s-waveform-reviewed"},{"text":"At last, James makes a nice bamboo brush pot.","start":64.5,"end":68.2,"method":"anchor","timing":"v4.1-0.1s-waveform-reviewed"},{"text":"“With your help, it becomes easier!”","start":69.2,"end":71.9,"method":"waveform-dp-v4","timing":"v4.1-0.1s-waveform-reviewed"},{"text":"James says.","start":73.0,"end":73.9,"method":"waveform-dp-v4","timing":"v4.1-0.1s-waveform-reviewed"}],"method":"v4.1-0.1s-waveform-reviewed","timingPrecision":0.1}}}